    rdfs:comment "Reusable with acknowledgement under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU, as above. Credit: © European Union, https://eur-lex.europa.eu. Read from the Publications Office, with a check of its records for later amendments. Used for facts only: nothing copied. Reliability: the law itself. Read in October 2026. Used for: which version of EN 301 549 is cited (the one built on WCAG 2.1), in chapter 9, which states the rule rather than the version number."@en .

<https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/web-accessibility-directive-standards-and-harmonisation>
    dcterms:title "Web Accessibility Directive: standards and harmonisation" ;
    dcterms:creator "European Commission" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
