                              "16 × 16 CSS-pixlar"@sv ,
                              "16×16 CSS 픽셀"@ko ,
                              "16 × 16 CSS-Pixel"@de ,
                              "16 por 16 píxeles CSS"@es ,
                              "16 par 16 pixels CSS"@fr ;
    solid-memo:distractorNote "No WCAG criterion uses 16 pixels as its size."@en ,
                              "Inget kriterium i WCAG använder 16 pixlar som storlek."@sv ,
